# Response headers for Cloudflare Workers Static Assets (parsed at deploy time,
# never served as a file). Added 2026-10-02 from the SEO audit.
#
# Caching: without this every file came back "max-age=0, must-revalidate", so a
# project page with 20-30 images paid a round trip per image on every visit.
# Media get 10 minutes, not days, on purpose: the CMS replaces files under the
# same name, and a long cache would show the old file for hours after a deploy.
# Fonts and the three.js build never change under their name, so they are
# cached for good.
#
# Security: the usual minimum. No Content-Security-Policy: inline module
# scripts, Sveltia in /admin/ and the Instagram links make a strict one fragile,
# and a loose one protects nothing.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000

/admin/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

/data/projects/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=600, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=600, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/js/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
